 make notes richer, and easily searchable. This is a positive feedback loop that helps make more connections between notes, as well.","topics":[],"score":250729,"global_rank":61065},{"name":"prateeksamudrala/CovidvsWorldHealthStats","owner":"prateeksamudrala","html_url":"https://github.com/prateeksamudrala/CovidvsWorldHealthStats","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Project: COVID death rate and World Health Statistics","topics":[],"score":250722,"global_rank":61074},{"name":"egagli/glacier-thickness-from-sar","owner":"egagli","html_url":"https://github.com/egagli/glacier-thickness-from-sar","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":250708,"global_rank":61096},{"name":"luongtruong77/deep-learning-fake-faces-generator","owner":"luongtruong77","html_url":"https://github.com/luongtruong77/deep-learning-fake-faces-generator","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"In this project, I will apply GAN to build the model to generate fake faces based on the popular celebA dataset.","topics":[],"score":250694,"global_rank":61113},{"name":"HarrisonLL/Basic_text_mining_project","owner":"HarrisonLL","html_url":"https://github.com/HarrisonLL/Basic_text_mining_project","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"The project was completed in November, 2019. Techniques used: Random Forest, TF-IDF matrix, SMOTE, l1 Regularization.","topics":[],"score":250685,"global_rank":61128},{"name":"marioymario/Human_Resourses_attrition","owner":"marioymario","html_url":"https://github.com/marioymario/Human_Resourses_attrition","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"attrition prediction","topics":[],"score":250684,"global_rank":61132},{"name":"reachsumit/The-Movie-Project","owner":"reachsumit","html_url":"https://github.com/reachsumi